Requirements You must use a {@item repair toolkit}
You spend 10 minutes affixing a {@trait talisman} to an item, placing the item on a stable surface and using the repair toolkit with both hands. You can also use this activity to remove a talisman. Attaching more than one talisman to an item deactivates all the talismans. They must be removed and re-affixed before they can be used again.

